00:00:00,921 --> 00:00:02,961
(Bernadette:)Do you know he once got
an asthma attack...

2
00:00:03,132 --> 00:00:06,092
(Bernadette:)...from reading an old library book?

3
00:00:07,011 --> 00:00:09,971
- You're kidding.
- No, I was there that day.

4
00:00:10,139 --> 00:00:13,769
(Penny:)Sheldon threw his back out
handing him that book.

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,730
(Bernadette:)I don't know what I'm going to do.

6
00:00:16,896 --> 00:00:18,566
(Bernadette:)I don't want to break up over this.

7
00:00:18,731 --> 00:00:20,771
Why don't you tell him
you made a mistake?

8
00:00:20,941 --> 00:00:23,781
(Bernadette:)Do you guys think it was a mistake?

9
00:00:23,944 --> 00:00:25,404
(Bernadette:)Am I the bad guy in this?

10
00:00:26,363 --> 00:00:29,913
It's not for us to judge. We're here
to provide comfort and support...

11
00:00:30,075 --> 00:00:33,995
(Amy:)...while you come to grips with
what a despicable thing you've done.

12
00:00:35,748 --> 00:00:37,538
(Bernadette:)Oh, God, you're right.

13
00:00:37,708 --> 00:00:42,008
(Bernadette:)I took our love and
threw it under his bus-sized mother.

14
00:00:44,632 --> 00:00:47,972
(Bernadette:)- I need to apologize.
- That's good, I'm glad you came to that.

15
00:00:48,135 --> 00:00:51,765
(Penny:)But before you do, let me just
ask you a big picture question.

16
00:00:51,931 --> 00:00:53,681
(Bernadette:)What?

17
00:00:53,849 --> 00:00:57,059
(Penny:)Are you a hundred percent positive
you love...

